 2: Time to swim the first 12 miles\n\nHe swims at **2 mph**, so:\n\n$$\n\\text{Time}_1 = \\frac{12 \\text{ miles}}{2 \\text{ mph}} = 6 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Rest time\n\nHe rests for **half as long as the swimming time**, so:\n\n$$\n\\text{Rest time} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 = 3 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 4: Time to swim the remaining 8 miles\n\nHe swims at **half the speed** = $ \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2 = 1 $ mph\n\n$$\n\\text{Time}_2 = \\frac{8 \\text{ miles}}{1 \\text{ mph}} = 8 \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 5: Total time\n\n$$\n\\text{Total time} = \\text{Time}_1 + \\text{Rest time} + \\text{Time}_2 = 6 + 3 + 8 = \\boxed{17} \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{17} \\text{ hours}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 11.430593260098249, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 115, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "1dcc42b5e996238af2758eea3f93fe612224aaf71cb9735fa66b74ea380cf0d0", "output_tokens": 424, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 21553905152, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 21831352320, "problem_id": "gsm8k/fb9167f06dd28b30", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 11465.01182904467}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "17", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 11.46501182904467, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 21831352320, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 21831352320, "sampling_seed": 1459529676873094356, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 424, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.033098394982516766, "turn_index": 0}
